# Springbloom Druid, "up to two" (CR 701.23b): Bot1 sacrifices its Forest and the library holds a single basic land, a Mountain, so only that one is found and arrives tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Springbloom Druid
Elvish Mystic
Elvish Mystic
Mountain
Elvish Mystic x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Springbloom Druid.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
Bot1.Search(Mountain)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Springbloom Druid; Mountain
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
